// IN-PROCESS: ops_triage diagnoses an unreachable page read-only, from the status the page answered.
//
// ops_triage has run in the gateway process since 2026-10-09 (container.disabled). It is a
// diagnose-only agent: it gathers the cheapest evidence and hands any fix to another agent. Here the
// evidence is one request to a page the fixture site does not have.
//
// Ground truth: eval/e2e/site has no kaputt.html, and nginx answers a missing path with 404
// (eval/e2e/env/nginx.conf: try_files $uri $uri/ =404).
//
// Audit row asserted: sub_agent_tool_call phase "done" with args and result (agent/sub-agent.ts
// buildSubAgentToolAuditPayload; resultPreview is the output, or the error of a failed call, with
// whitespace collapsed). Every way the agent's read tools can meet that 404 puts it there:
//   - service_check http: "HTTP check failed after 1 attempt(s): HTTP 404 from <url>", or with
//     expectedStatus 404 "... returned HTTP 404" (tools/service-check.ts);
//   - web_fetch: "HTTP 404 from <url>", or, when the browser rendered nginx's error page,
//     "(browser-rendered; a direct request was answered HTTP 404)" before "404 Not Found"
//     (tools/web.ts).
// So the row is matched on the 404 in its preview, not on success. service_check needs per-call
// approval (guardrails/tool-tiers.ts), hence --auto. Read-only: no file is written or edited.
{
  id: "inprocess-ops-triage-404-diagnosis",
  title: "In-process ops_triage: an unreachable page is diagnosed read-only as HTTP 404",
  group: "inprocess",
  tags: ["inprocess", "ops_triage", "site", "diagnosis"],
  description: "ops_triage (in-process since 2026-10-09) is told that http://www.nordlicht-werkzeuge.test/kaputt.html is unreachable and asked for the cause, read-only. Protects: the in-process diagnostic path to the fixture site (web_fetch or service_check dispatched by ops_triage on that URL and observing the 404), a finding grounded in that observation (the reply names 404), and a diagnosis that changes nothing (no write_file or edit_file).",
  requires: ["model", "e2e-site"],
  timeoutMs: 900000,
  steps: [
    {
      kind: "turn",
      id: "diagnose",
      agent: "ops_triage",
      message: "Die Seite http://www.nordlicht-werkzeuge.test/kaputt.html ist für Kunden nicht erreichbar. Finde die Ursache nur lesend heraus: Prüfe die Adresse selbst und nenne den HTTP-Status als Befund. Ändere nichts. --auto",
      timeoutMs: 600000,
      expect: {
        reply: { matches: ["\\b404\\b"] },
        agents: { mustRun: ["ops_triage"] },
        tools: { mustNotCall: ["write_file", "edit_file"] },
        events: {
          must: [
            {
              type: "sub_agent_tool_call",
              where: {
                "data.agentName": "ops_triage",
                "data.tool": { in: ["web_fetch", "service_check"] },
                "data.phase": "done",
                "data.args.url": { regex: "^https?://www\\.nordlicht-werkzeuge\\.test/kaputt\\.html$" },
                "data.resultPreview": { regex: "\\b404\\b" },
              },
            },
          ],
        },
      },
    },
  ],
}
